  "interventions": [
    "Three-core development board, experimental sparse register latches/idle assumptions, dual RAM layout and explicit bootloader GIC flag; real camera reset values unverified.",
    "Owned execution snapshot bypasses SRIC hardware startup waits with failure results and enters original GUI/domain initialization. Source firmware on disk remains unchanged.",
    "Missing persistent domain storage returns original negative results; non-GUI SystemControl hardware/NV dispatch is isolated without fabricated ACKs.",
    "Original heap, Resource constructor and bounded read-only file backend load exact firmware fonts/sounds. Original DataRom and SystemControl load exact ICONBIN through four-byte logical blocks.",
    "Original constructors/bind/activate/convert create a persistent 720x480 software display. Native SetRect and Canvas draw produce all captured pixels; absent physical LCD gate is bypassed for this component.",
